;;; Helper prefix zol-.  The acn- helpers below are COPIED from theorem-library/analytic-continuation.scm
;;; (a helper is local to its file); they serve the Taylor-coefficient lemma, which is that file's (5)/(6)
;;; with the hypothesis "f vanishes to every order at c" in place of "the zeros of f accumulate at c".

